00:08:46.001 --> 00:08:47.000
[...]

158
00:08:47.001 --> 00:08:48.000
No te vayas.

159
00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.000
¡Levántate Cindy!

160
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.000
